// PARAM: --analysis interval
// pretty_string_of_program prints Return None as bare "return" (no
// expression), but vimp_parser.ml's KW_RETURN case used to unconditionally
// require an aexp afterward -- found by tests/property's round-trip
// property (Hypothesis generated Return None, print/parse disagreed).
// main itself may not contain a return (wf_source_program's no_return
// conjunct), so the bare return lives in a helper procedure p instead,
// called destination-less (a bare return provides no value).
void p() {
  __voblint_check(1 < 2); // PROVED
  return
}
void main() {
  p()
}
